CORE
main.c
--datarace --no-assertions --no-por --unwind 2 --rounds 3 --allow-pointer-unsoundness
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The barrier waits for both threads, so the write before it in the thread is
ordered before main's write after it. The old model returned at once and
ordered nothing.
